{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Me cuesta hablar de mí","A la actriz Charo López le cuesta hablar de sí misma. Pero basta con que comience a recordar para que descubrir que su vida ha sido excepcional. ¿Cómo una estudiante de Filología de Salamanca acabó siendo actriz y musa de toda una generación? ¿Por qué, cuando en los 70 copaba entrevistas y portadas, estuvo a punto de dejarlo todo? ¿Es posible llegar a lo más alto haciendo cine, teatro y televisión? ¿Y por qué, pase el tiempo que pase, sigue tan presente en nuestra memoria?",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"celebrity","artistic creation","personal memory","cultural memory","desire","homosociality","intragenerational friendship","high rank employment","mass media",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":19,"filmType":23,"directors":24,"genre":33,"media":37,"synopsis":40,"production":41,"characters":44,"roles":45,"awards":106,"tags":3},"Film","ES2022_093","es2022-093-me-cuesta-hablar-de-mi",{"native":1,"english":18},"",{"type":20,"date":21,"year":22},"Theatrical release","2022-02-28",2022,"Documentary",[25],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":32},"Chema de la Peña","chema-de-la-pena",1964,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[],[34,35,36],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Metacinema","Biopic",{"posterUrl":38,"trailerUrl":39},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt15655792/mediaviewer/rm1312224513/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/evideos.php?movie_id=651026",{"native":2,"english":18},[42],{"country":31,"share":43},"Majority coproducer",[],[46,54,58,64,70,76,82,88,94,100],{"person":47,"role":53},{"id":48,"slug":49,"name":48,"birthYear":50,"deathYear":29,"gender":51,"nationality":31,"awards":52},"Charo López","charo-lopez",1943,"Female identifying",[],"Documentary subject",{"person":55,"role":57},{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":